	.TITLE	MAC113F	a register name after an operator in data
;
; Phase 113's probe round 2 (testdata/err113's README): round 1's MAC113A found
; VMS's MACRO refusing a register name that begins a data item (R1, R1+4). govax
; takes 4+R1 as an expression with a symbol R1 (undefined). Is it?
;
	.PSECT	DATA, NOEXE,WRT,LONG
A:	.LONG	4+R1
B:	.LONG	1,4+R2
C:	.WORD	2*R3
D:	.ADDRESS 4+R4
E:	.LONG	<R5>
	.END
